    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0312" n="236" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg236"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1923</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Russell.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-09-08T11:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 8, 1916, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your September 5, 11 a.m. Unless financial control and establishment of
                    constabulary definitely assured and made binding in <pb facs="0313" n="237"
                        xml:id="pg237"/> future Department feels it cannot change its present
                    attitude toward Government of Henríquez. You may intimate this to the present
                    Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
